    "title": "Optimus Remote Search Pilot",
    "version": "1.0.0-candidate",
    "description": "Independent of local SearchHost. Eight Spanish summaries. Not deployed. HTTPS required at approved remote origin; per-client credentials, no device-profile tokens. Errors may occur before route dispatch. No query strings, cookies, Origin header or CORS. Described error JSON/headers apply to application-generated responses. Kestrel may reject malformed HTTP or request line/header limits before the application, with empty body and statuses such as400/414/431; clients must handle those as failures."
  },
